    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n99671" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνδι-αιρέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>divide together</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.425b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>Inst.</u>
				123
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>in Nic.</u>
				p.3
			</span></i> P., <i><span class="en">
				Dam.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				205
			</span></i>; <i>to be incised together</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Heliod.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
