				45.7.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>divide the proceeds</i> of a robbery, <u>PCair.</u>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Zen.</u>
				491
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>; but, <i>divide, share</i> a property,
				<i><span class="en">
				<u>PTeb.</u>
				383.48
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>divide in addition, include in a division</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PEnteux.</u>
					65.15
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>.</div>
